      "trackName": "Watch Games Max: Offline",
      "description": "A little arcade, always within reach.\n\nWatch Games Max brings 80+ mini games to iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch. Solve a puzzle on your phone, make a tiny bead creation, or lift your wrist for a quick arcade challenge. There is something for a short break and something worth trying one more time.\n\nCLASSICS YOU CAN PICK UP IN SECONDS\nSlide numbers in 2048, chase a new Snake score, clear falling blocks, uncover Minesweeper tiles and work through Sudoku. Enjoy brick breaking, memory matching, sliding puzzles, tic-tac-toe and more familiar favorites in one collection.\n\nMORE WAYS TO PLAY\nAim a shot in Pool or Mini Golf. Keep the ball moving in Pinball, line up a Bowling throw or try a game of Curling. Run across rooftops, dodge obstacles in three lanes, defend your base in Tank Keep, plan an escape in Bomb Maze, or set up a satisfying Marble Chain combo.\n\nMAKE SOMETHING, OR JUST UNWIND\nBuild a design bead by bead in Bead Studio and watch it fuse into a little keepsake. Try the Claw Machine, merge fruit, slice flying fruit or enjoy quick sound-and-motion toys such as Air Gun and Air Boxing. Each game keeps its own character, with tactile-looking artwork, sound effects and responsive animation.\n\nMADE FOR YOUR WRIST\nApple Watch layouts put the game first. Tap, swipe or drag directly on the play area, with Digital Crown controls in games where they help. Selected small-board puzzles support Crown zoom and drag-to-pan so you can reach the details. Motion controls and haptic feedback are available in supported games and devices.\n\nYOUR NEXT QUICK BREAK\nMost gameplay runs offline once the app is installed. Play while waiting, commuting or taking a moment for yourself, without signing up for an app account. Keep track of supported game records and high scores, and pin favorite games for easier access. Game availability and controls vary by device.\n\nFREE PLAY AND PRO\nSelected games or basic modes are free. Some games include a limited first-play experience; many games and additional content require Pro. Choose a monthly or annual subscription, or a one-time lifetime unlock. Purchases, restoring access and refreshing membership may require an internet connection. Membership status can be shared between a paired iPhone and Apple Watch; game progress is not universally synchronized.\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://www.doudousoftware.com/watch_games_max_privacy_policy_english.html\n\nSUBSCRIPTION INFORMATION\n• Monthly Pro subscription: automatically renews.\n• Annual Pro subscription: automatically renews.\n• Lifetime Pro unlock: a one-time purchase.\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account is charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel subscriptions in your App Store account settings after purchase. Prices are shown in the app and may vary by region.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA):\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
